// Title: Copy Passwd Or Shadow From TMP Path
// Rule ID: fa4aaed5-4fe0-498d-bbc0-08e3346387ba
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1552.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
